  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b90acb33a755d494cafdd1d36518e58b, type: 2}
    textENG: "We\u2019re in the middle of nowhere, and you just\u2026 lock the station?\r\nWho
      does that?"
    textPL: "Jeste\u015Bmy po\u015Brodku niczego, a wy zamkn\u0119li\u015Bcie dworzec?\r\nKto
      tak robi?"
    expressionName: furious
